  "note": "Election of the Cookstown Urban District Council, ordinary day 16 May 1938; the four retiring members were returned unopposed (Belfast News-Letter, 7 May 1938, p. 9). 'The following members of Cookstown Urban Council, who retired this year, were returned unopposed yesterday — Messrs. Samuel M'Kinney, George Ferguson, George Ramsay, J.P., and J. M'D. Scott. There were only four nominations received.' Returned unopposed."
